cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use QRAFT HPC in your research, cite this software and record the exact release or commit used."
type: software
title: "QRAFT HPC: Declarative, evidence-oriented orchestration for scientific HPC campaigns"
authors:
  - given-names: Jairo
    family-names: Carmona
repository-code: "https://github.com/Jairomcarmona/siestaflow"
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  QRAFT HPC is a declarative orchestrator for scientific HPC campaigns. It validates
  execution plans, executes through registered launchers, and preserves
  attempts and execution evidence. SIESTA is the currently implemented backend.
